{"page":436,"width":1748,"height":2651,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"11.1 대용량 저장장치 구조의 개관","words":[{"text":"11.1","x":1052,"y":153,"width":54,"height":23},{"text":"대용량","x":1124,"y":152,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"저장장치","x":1201,"y":150,"width":93,"height":28},{"text":"구조의","x":1302,"y":152,"width":72,"height":25},{"text":"개관","x":1384,"y":151,"width":46,"height":26}]},{"text":"자기 EPP(Magnetic Tapes)","words":[{"text":"자기","x":699,"y":327,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"EPP(Magnetic","x":776,"y":327,"width":255,"height":41},{"text":"Tapes)","x":1044,"y":326,"width":104,"height":41}]},{"text":"497","words":[{"text":"497","x":1503,"y":147,"width":60,"height":30}]},{"text":"자기 테이프는 초기의 보조저장장치 매체로 사용되었다. 비록 자기 테이프가 비휘","words":[{"text":"자기","x":330,"y":406,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"테이프는","x":413,"y":407,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"초기의","x":557,"y":408,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"보조저장장치","x":668,"y":408,"width":183,"height":37},{"text":"매체로","x":868,"y":407,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"사용되었다.","x":973,"y":406,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"비록","x":1154,"y":406,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"자기","x":1229,"y":405,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"테이프가","x":1310,"y":405,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"비휘","x":1457,"y":406,"width":62,"height":38}]},{"text":"발성이고, 많은 양의 데이터를 보관할 수 있지만, 메인 메모리와 드라이브와 비교","words":[{"text":"발성이고,","x":332,"y":465,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"많은","x":489,"y":468,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"양의","x":570,"y":469,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":650,"y":467,"width":124,"height":39},{"text":"보관할","x":788,"y":467,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":894,"y":468,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"있지만,","x":941,"y":467,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"메인","x":1056,"y":467,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"메모리와","x":1133,"y":467,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"드라이브와","x":1275,"y":467,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"비교","x":1458,"y":468,"width":65,"height":37}]},{"text":"할 때 접근 시간이 느리다. 자기 테이프에